WEBVTT

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.300
It's been so hot.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.170
Yeah, I'm really concerned
about my field.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.900
Well, I heard my neighbor had
a good harvest of watermelons.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.720
What are they?

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.000
What? Isn't that a coffin?

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:54.040
Did someone die?

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.110
No, I didn't hear that.

00:00:57.310 --> 00:01:01.110
Excuse me,
but what is that box you have?

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:08.180
Grave markers for all of you.

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:19.570
GENJI

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.910
GENZO

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.930
GENTA

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:52.890
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:57.330
...and lead them to ruin.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:03.340
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:07.740
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:10.880
...in the human world.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:14.740
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:21.380
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:27.090
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:31.290
No one knows her true face.

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:38.030
Well, I guess it's okay.

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:06.180
- We never saw you around here.
- What are you here for?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.960
- I'm just traveling through.
- Looking like that?

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:13.760
Suspicious. She must be
one of the Shinma.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:15.730
Shinma?

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:19.170
Don't pretend you don't know!
Let's kill her.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:24.330
Wait. She doesn't look like she has
a weapon. Better to keep her hostage.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:28.180
Let's do that.
Hey, come this way!

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:32.180
I guess I don't have any other choice.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.820
Get in and stay there!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.590
Oh, what a nice surprise
to see you here.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:48.630
I was bored all by myself.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:53.140
- Where are we?
- It's a strange village, isn't it?

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:57.210
The Shinma must have called for us.
I'm sure of it.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:01.440
- Do you have something to do with this?
- I don't know.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:04.810
- But, Ms. Sato...
- Just go ahead and open it.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:09.680
If you try to let them escape, we
won't tolerate it. Not even from you.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:17.890
I brought you a meal. If you have any
problems, don't hesitate to tell me.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.430
- I don't have any complaints.
- I'm sorry.

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:25.660
Everyone is on edge.
When my father returns...

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:28.070
- Your father?
- He's the village chief.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:32.270
He went to a village at the foot
of the mountain to find a fighter.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:36.180
- A village at the foot of the mountain?
- Yes. What about it?

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:41.250
- Why don't you go to the police?
- Why the police?

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:47.530
She doesn't seem to be involved.
We were mistaken for Shinma.

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:51.260
What is happening in this village?

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:54.030
It's my fault.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:58.710
Chief, how did it go?
We caught these allies of the Shinma.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.170
Allies?

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:03.110
Father, these people...

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:11.980
Please pardon our rudeness.
What an outrageous thing you did!

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:15.050
She is a Shusuji,
a descendant of our Master!

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:20.350
- Shusuji? That young girl?
- You must be furious. I apologize.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:23.120
Please come to our house.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:27.600
Well, it looks like
I need to thank you, Miyu.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.360
But what is a Shusuji?

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:32.800
I don't even know what that is.

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.280
Did you find somebody
who can help fight?

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.680
Not quite yet.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:44.910
Then why have we
tolerated this so far?

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:49.790
The only thing we can do is to hand
your daughter Sato to the Shinma.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.930
That's not...
Please wait a little longer.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.190
No, we can't take it anymore.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:59.830
Unless we hand her over as a bride,
they will come back to attack us.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:06.000
They will ruin our crops, set fire to
our houses and might kill all of us.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:09.770
Isn't it your duty
to protect this village?

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:12.570
You'll pay dearly
for not doing anything.

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:14.010
I know.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:18.120
In any case, wait a little longer.
I promise I will do something.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:20.980
We will not accept any excuses!

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:24.560
So there are Shinma here.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:28.700
Yes. But it has nothing
to do with all of you.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:31.330
Please leave this village immediately.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:34.900
It's not that easy.
I have my reasons.

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.870
I already know.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:41.840
That is all the more reason
I cannot let you stay any longer.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.270
You know?

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:46.850
I am a descendant
of Shinma Protectors.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:51.440
- What? I can't believe it.
- You?

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:57.220
Our family duty, for generations,
is to serve and protect the Guardians.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:01.330
We have mixed with humans
and lost much of our power.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:03.860
But we have not forgotten our duty.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:06.560
What about your daughter?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:10.430
Three brother Shinma requested
Sato as a bride.

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:14.040
They might have found out
about our family background.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:18.370
But that is for me to take care of.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:21.170
I cannot let it injure you.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:24.910
Do you think a Guardian
can let Shinma pass?

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:28.750
Otherwise, I'll lose face.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:32.650
I can't let those monsters bother you.

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:37.090
What to do with stray Shinma
is up to me, a Guardian.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:42.070
If you descend from Shinma Protectors,
it's all the more reason to obey me.

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:43.460
Well, that's...

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:46.370
- When are they coming?
- Tomorrow at noon.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:52.140
Don't hand your daughter over.
That would give them more confidence.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.940
I don't mind!

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.410
You should mind.

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:59.420
I'm the only daughter in this family.
I am prepared.

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:01.490
That's not right.

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:07.750
Despite your duties in the past,
you need to live as a human now.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:11.730
It's silly to be bound with
family and its traditional duties.

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:15.060
Let us take care of this.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:17.570
I am indebted to your family.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:22.300
I will not endanger all of you.

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:36.160
You are extremely gentle
to those people.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.990
I thought you didn't care
about humans.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.430
I was thinking about my father.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.830
Oh, that's it!

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:49.560
I couldn't figure out why you were
backing humans, though we are one.

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:54.970
Yes, it stems from
before "l" became "we."

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.340
What a pitiful incident it was.

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:01.120
Don't describe it
in such simple words!

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.750
My father was... Miyu, you...

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:06.080
He was almost killed by you!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.750
I was watching too.
Now I remember what happened then.

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:12.860
If you tell me to atone for it,
I will.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.960
If you're so compassionate...

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:19.760
...you wouldn't ignore that father's
feeling toward his daughter.

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:24.160
I have not forgotten my debt to them.
I will protect them.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.900
No, we will take care of it.

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:29.370
This is our battle as well.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:34.040
Miyu, we don't want you
to get involved.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.230
Isn't this exciting, Genzo?

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:59.340
Yes, big brother.
The wedding is tonight.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:04.470
Chief! Genzo, youngest of
the three Shinma brothers...

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:07.910
...has come to receive your daughter!

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:16.520
They don't seem
to understand our power yet.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.560
Who are you?

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.130
I can't let you pass.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:28.000
I'm Miyu, a Guardian,
and your time has come.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:33.170
If you are stray Shinma,
give up and be obedient.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:36.400
A Guardian? Oh, I see, you are...

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.070
Big brother?

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:42.910
Interesting.
Let us see what you can do.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:02.030
I just came to pick up my bride.
I will not tolerate any interruption!

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:04.670
A stray Shinma is receiving a bride?

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:08.640
That's pretty arrogant.
Hurry back to the darkness!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:12.480
You're just a doll.
I'll trash you first.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:15.720
Matsukaze is my own self.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:20.480
If you want to show off your power,
you must defeat both of us together.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.050
That's exactly what I'm going to do!

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:25.950
You won't touch
this father and daughter.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:30.930
This is territory that we control,
and you still want to fight?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.700
What will you do
if we choose to fight?

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.300
What? What a sassy little girl!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.840
Calm down, Genzo. She is a Guardian.
Don't let your guard down.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:45.100
I don't care. I have no desire
to deal with children!

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:48.010
I only want that woman!

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.080
Fire!

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:06.190
- What's wrong? You were feisty earlier!
- Larva!

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:11.170
- Your servant isn't coming today, huh?
- No surprise.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.870
He won't be able to get here.
Let's leave Miyu alone.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:20.210
I can't do that. More fighters
makes for a better fight.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:32.790
She is pretty strong for
a young girl. Should I help?

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:36.230
It's not necessary.
It turned out to be a wild dowry.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:40.560
But if he is too weak to win,
he doesn't deserve a bride.

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.240
Fire!

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:56.310
- Genzo!
- Big brother!

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:06.120
My little brother!

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:11.390
Wait, Genji. I've heard Guardians are
compassionate toward human feelings.

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:14.630
Oh, is that so? Here we go!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.880
How do you like it? A massacre!

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.550
Hurry! Run!

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:41.320
- You still don't understand?
- This village is an enclosed world!

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:45.990
The outside is nothing but a backdrop.
There's no place to run to.

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:49.900
Even if that's the case,
I can't leave them alone.

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:56.840
Miyu! Fire again!

00:15:57.050 --> 00:15:59.810
Give us a big one!

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:24.130
It's no use. Our souls are
imbedded into this flag.

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:26.270
He is a tough opponent.

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:29.810
What about our blizzard?

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:54.630
I'm going to let both of you
get in there together.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:17:00.310
Please, stop! I will hand over
my daughter. So, please...

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:05.210
Too late! The bridegroom is
already dead, because of them!

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:09.710
Hey, big brother. Since the chief
is making such an offer...

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.910
...why don't we take her as a bride?

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:15.890
A bride for the world of the dead!

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:21.290
- I will not hand her over!
- Shut your big mouth!

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.730
Don't give up!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:40.810
I have performed the duty of my clan.

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:43.380
Please look after my daughter.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:56.260
I won't forgive you!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.380
Genji!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.850
How dare you defeat
my little brothers!

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:24.010
I'm a Guardian. It is my duty to send
stray Shinma back to the darkness.

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:28.290
- Now you are the only one left here.
- No. We want you to stop it!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:32.060
The village has burnt down.
Many people died.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:36.230
It's all because of you
and the Shinma! Get out!

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.170
Ms. Sato!

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:41.970
Miyu, don't fight. That girl is...

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:44.670
She is me.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:51.150
So, what are you gonna do?
What are you doing? Stop!

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:56.750
I'm my father's daughter.
Please perform your duty!

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:13.830
Miyu, it's no use to stop them.

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:36.360
Finally it's nice and quiet.

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:38.030
I agree.

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:43.100
Fire!

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.310
It's time for you to give up!

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:13.430
Into the darkness, Shinma!

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:26.380
Why did you die?

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:31.040
You had been released
from your duty a long time ago.

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:39.020
It's Miyu's fault. If she hadn't come,
we'd be living here happily forever.

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:42.820
We would have been able
to destroy the Shinma ourselves.

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:45.800
Miyu, I will never forgive you.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.330
I don't expect you to.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:52.970
Then be prepared before we meet again.

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:57.740
There are people whose lives
are ruined because of a Guardian.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:01.010
We will settle this, Miyu.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:13.930
My fault.

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:21.060
I'm sorry. It took me a while to find
the crack to enter this foreign space.

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:25.230
- It's all over.
- I'm glad you are all right.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:31.840
No. I shouldn't have been here.
Let's return.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:45.980
I will never forget
about the Shinma Protectors.

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:51.150
What I did with the best intentions
turned out to be devastating to them.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:55.730
I need to live on as a Guardian.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:59.270
That is my destiny.

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:19.020
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.560
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:21.760 --> 00:22:25.700
...from so far away?

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:28.530
Someone smooths down my hair

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:32.800
Who are you?

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:39.470
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:44.310
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:48.790
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:53.260
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.460 --> 00:22:57.450
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:01.930
Washed away

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:08.740
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.180
Invited by the moon

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:17.110
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:26.280
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:26.530 --> 00:23:33.460
The sky cries for me

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:46.670
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:49.210
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:49.420 --> 00:23:53.350
...from so far away?

00:23:53.550 --> 00:23:56.180
Someone smooths down my hair

00:23:56.390 --> 00:24:00.450
Who are you?

00:24:03.130 --> 00:24:07.120
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:11.970
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:12.170 --> 00:24:16.440
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:20.910
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:21.120 --> 00:24:25.110
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:25.320 --> 00:24:29.590
Washed away

00:24:32.290 --> 00:24:36.390
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:36.600 --> 00:24:40.830
Invited by the moon

00:24:41.040 --> 00:24:44.770
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:47.410 --> 00:24:53.940
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:54.180 --> 00:25:01.110
The sky cries for me

00:25:05.760 --> 00:25:09.700
I wanted to ride on a train.
I wanted to go on a trip.

00:25:09.900 --> 00:25:13.390
I was just an innocent child.

00:25:14.440 --> 00:25:17.890
Birds came when
the harvest season arrived.

00:25:18.110 --> 00:25:21.970
Then I learned the meaning
of starting a journey.

00:25:22.180 --> 00:25:25.910
Everything is a one-act play
in the distant past.

00:25:26.110 --> 00:25:31.210
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu,
"Once Upon a Time."

00:25:31.420 --> 00:25:33.390
Mother...
